:''Not to be confused with [[Cat Godzilla (Rare Cat)|Cat Godzilla]].''
'''Godzilla Cat''' is a [[:Category:Rare Cats|Rare Cat]] introduced in [[Version 10.6 Update|Version 10.6]] and could be unlocked by clearing any stage in [[Godzilla Collaboration Event#Godzilla vs Cats|Godzilla vs Cats]] of the [[Godzilla Collaboration Event]].

{{Cat Info
|ID = 611
|rarity = RR
|name1 = Godzilla Cat
|name2 = Shin Godzilla Cat
}}

==Evolution==
Evolves into '''Shin Godzilla Cat''' at level 10.

==Strategy/Usage==
This unit is unfortunately outclassed by other [[:Category:Anti-Dark Cats|anti-Dark]] units due to its awful stats and [[Single Attack]] attack. Because of that, this unit provides no use compared to other units such as [[Weightlifter Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Pizza Cat]], [[Flower Cat (Special Cat)|Bombercat]], [[Salon Cat (Rare Cat)|Cyborg Cat]], and [[Lizard Cat (Normal Cat)|Dragon Cat]]. The latter of them outclass its niche of a ranged attacker, and the former of them outclasses its niche as an anti-Dark unit.

{{Job|Classification = User Rank Dump}}

